                                                "sense_id": "b08dd241-cdeb-3639-99ce-4ab159766cc8",
                                                "text": "A more refined version is the concept of restless capitalism developed by Metcalfe, working on the evolutionary theory of economic change by Nelson and Winter. In both cases, the economy is in a state of disequilibrium all of the time."
